"Feels light and doesn't turn on.\n"
"Does that matter?"
msgstr "Pesa poco y no se enciende.\n¿Importa?"

#. TRANSLATORS: item hint on use
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_Laptop.tres
msgid "I was supposed to do something with this."
msgstr "Tenía que hacer algo con esto."

#. TRANSLATORS: item name
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_LaptopReal.tres
msgid "CEOs Laptop"
msgstr "Portátil del director"

#. TRANSLATORS: item description
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_LaptopReal.tres
msgid "The CEO's laptop. There's probably a lot of valuable data on here."
msgstr "El portátil del director. Seguro que tiene datos valiosos."

#. TRANSLATORS: item hint on use
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_LaptopReal.tres
msgid "I was supposed to do somoething with this."
msgstr "Tenía que hacer algo con esto."

