msgstr "Munición láser"

#. TRANSLATORS: item description
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_LaserAmmo.tres
msgid "Tends to get hot. One clip has a charge of 50."
msgstr "Se calienta. Cada cargador tiene 50 de carga."

#. TRANSLATORS: item name
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_PageCombined.tres
msgid "Combined Page"
msgstr "Página unida"

#. TRANSLATORS: item description
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_PageCombined.tres
msgid ""
"Reassembled page from the ripped pieces. It says \"New code is 0451\" on it."
msgstr "Página rehecha con los trozos rotos. Pone \"El nuevo código es 0451\"."

#. TRANSLATORS: item hint on use
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_PageCombined.tres
msgid "I should probably read this."
msgstr "Debería leer esto."

#. TRANSLATORS: item name
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_RippedPage_A.tres
msgid "Ripped Page A"
msgstr "Página rota A"

#. TRANSLATORS: item description
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_RippedPage_A.tres
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_RippedPage_B.tres
msgid ""
"A piece of paper ripped in half. It has some numbers on it but parts are "
"missing."
msgstr "Un papel roto por la mitad. Tiene números, pero faltan partes."

#. TRANSLATORS: item hint on use
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_RippedPage_A.tres
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_RippedPage_B.tres
msgid "I need the other half."
msgstr "Necesito la otra mitad."

#. TRANSLATORS: item name
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_RippedPage_B.tres
msgid "Ripped Page B"
msgstr "Página rota B"

#. TRANSLATORS: item name
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_StaminaExtPotion.tres
msgid "Stamina Extension"
msgstr "Mejora de aguante"

#. TRANSLATORS: item hint on use
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_StaminaExtPotion.tres
msgid "Your max stamina has increased by 15."
msgstr "Tu aguante máximo ha subido 15."

#. TRANSLATORS: item name
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_StrengthPotion.tres
msgid "Strength Potion"
msgstr "Poción de fuerza"

#. TRANSLATORS: item description
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_StrengthPotion.tres
msgid "Raw eggs, protein powder, spinach and eleven herbs and spices."
msgstr "Huevos crudos, proteína en polvo, espinacas y once hierbas y especias."

#. TRANSLATORS: item hint on use
#: addons/cogito/InventoryPD/Items/Cogito_StrengthPotion.tres
msgid "Your strength improved!"
msgstr "¡Tu fuerza ha mejorado!"

#. TRANSLATORS: item name
