#. TRANSLATORS: quest objective description
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneObjectives/Demo_AccessArchiveObj.tres
msgid "CQO_EnterArchive"
msgstr "Encuentra la forma de entrar en el archivo."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest objective description
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneObjectives/Demo_StealLaptopObj1.tres
msgid "Find and steal the CEOs laptop."
msgstr "Roba el portátil del director"

#. TRANSLATORS: quest objective description
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneObjectives/Demo_StealLaptopObj2.tres
msgid "Deliver the laptop to the hidden compartment in the fridge."
msgstr "Deja el portátil en el compartimento secreto de la nevera."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest objective description
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneObjectives/Demo_TargetPracticeObj.tres
msgid "Destroy 5 targets."
msgstr "Destruye 5 dianas."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest title
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_AccessArchive.tres
msgid "Gain access to the archive."
msgstr "Entra en el archivo."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest description active
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_AccessArchive.tres
msgid "You won't be able to just walk in, but we're sure you'll find away."
msgstr "No podrás entrar sin más, pero seguro que encuentras la forma."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest description completed
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_AccessArchive.tres
msgid "You're in!"
msgstr "¡Estás dentro!"

#. TRANSLATORS: quest description failed
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_AccessArchive.tres
msgid "You should've not been able to fail this."
msgstr "No deberías haber podido fallar esto."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest title
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_StealLaptop.tres
msgid "Steal the CEO's laptop"
msgstr "Roba el portátil del director"

#. TRANSLATORS: quest description active
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_StealLaptop.tres
msgid ""
"We need the data on that laptop. As soon as you have it in your possession, "
"we'll let you know the next steps."
msgstr "Necesitamos los datos de ese portátil. En cuanto lo tengas, te diremos los siguientes pasos."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest description completed
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_StealLaptop.tres
msgid ""
"You managed to find the laptop and deliver the data we needed. Great work!"
msgstr "Encontraste el portátil y entregaste los datos. ¡Buen trabajo!"

#. TRANSLATORS: quest description failed
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_StealLaptop.tres
msgid "The laptop you delivered was fake! Do not contact us again."
msgstr "¡El portátil era falso! No vuelvas a contactarnos."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest title
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_TargetPractice.tres
msgid "Target Practice"
msgstr "Prácticas de tiro"

#. TRANSLATORS: quest description active
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_TargetPractice.tres
msgid ""
"Time to show off your skills with a weapon! Pick one up and give it a go!"
msgstr "¡A lucirse con un arma! Coge una y prueba."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest description completed
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_TargetPractice.tres
msgid "You showed those targets who's boss."
msgstr "Les has enseñado a esas dianas quién manda."

#. TRANSLATORS: quest description failed
#: addons/cogito/QuestSystem/Quests/DemoSceneQuests/Demo_TargetPractice.tres
msgid "You should not be able to fail this."
msgstr "No deberías poder fallar esto."

